          "htmlContent": "\u003ch2 style=\u0027margin:0 0 8px\u0027\u003eComprehensive Field Showcase\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis form demonstrates \u003cstrong\u003eevery supported field type\u003c/strong\u003e in a realistic clinical/business context. Use it to explore rendering, validation, and conditional logic.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eSections:\u003c/em\u003e Demographics \u0026rarr; Choices \u0026rarr; Scales \u0026rarr; Matrix \u0026rarr; Free Text \u0026rarr; Media \u0026rarr; Summary\u003c/p\u003e",
